<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Rental Service at $16, top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Rental Service at $16, top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Rental Service Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					  16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		   14-16</p>
<p>   Number of Shares				5.5</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   William Blair &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company raised the number of shares from its initial proposal of 4,929,000 shares. The offering is expected to riase $88 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Scottsdale, Arizona-based Rental Service rents out pumps, generators, forklifts, air compressors, and other industrial equipment.</p>
</text>
